[{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"用字母表示数时，字母表示什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"一个可以变化的数"},{"key":"B","text":"只能表示 1"},{"key":"C","text":"表示图形的名字，不能计算"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"字母可以表示变化的数，也可以参加运算。","verify":"'一个可以变化的数'","id":"cnm_p142_q1","topicId":"cnm_p142"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"a＝6 时，5×a 是多少？","answer":"30","explanation":"把 a 换成 6：5×6＝30。","verify":"5*6","id":"cnm_p142_q2","topicId":"cnm_p142"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"每支铅笔 a 元，买 5 支，一共要付多少元？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"a＋5 元"},{"key":"B","text":"5×a 元"},{"key":"C","text":"a÷5 元"},{"key":"D","text":"a－5 元"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"5 支的总价是单价乘数量：5×a 元。","verify":"'5×a 元'","id":"cnm_p142_q3","topicId":"cnm_p142"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"每支铅笔 a 元，每块橡皮比铅笔贵 2 元。买 3 支铅笔和 1 块橡皮，a＝4 时一共多少元？","answer":"18","explanation":"橡皮是 a＋2＝6（元）。3×4＋6＝18（元）。","verify":"3*4+(4+2)","id":"cnm_p142_q4","topicId":"cnm_p142"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"等式两边同时加上或减去同一个数，相等关系怎样？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"相等关系不变"},{"key":"B","text":"只有左边变了"},{"key":"C","text":"等式就不成立了"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"两边做同样的加减，左右仍然相等。","verify":"'相等关系不变'","id":"cnm_p144_q1","topicId":"cnm_p144"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"已知 18＝12＋6。两边同时减去 6，左边变成多少？","answer":"12","explanation":"左边 18－6＝12，右边也同样减去 6。","verify":"18-6","id":"cnm_p144_q2","topicId":"cnm_p144"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"已知 a＝b，等式两边同时加上 5，下面哪个等式仍然成立？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"a＋5＝b"},{"key":"B","text":"a＋5＝b＋5"},{"key":"C","text":"a＝b＋5"},{"key":"D","text":"a－5＝b＋5"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"两边都要加上 5，所以 a＋5＝b＋5。","verify":"'a＋5＝b＋5'","id":"cnm_p144_q3","topicId":"cnm_p144"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"天平左右平衡，左边是 40 克。两边同时拿走 15 克，然后两边再同时放上 7 克。现在左边是多少克？","answer":"32","explanation":"左边跟着变：40－15＋7＝32（克）。右边做了同样的事，天平仍然平衡。","verify":"40-15+7","id":"cnm_p144_q4","topicId":"cnm_p144"}]
